@@@!atrep-hom
@=at-org=>at-html

@@/ Org's emphasis family narrows: underline and strike become
@@/ classed spans, description terms extract into strong lines,
@@/ tables ride the verse sim, links and footnote bodies
@@/ dissolve (their deixes go with them).

@:: * !
@:: _ , .underline
@:: + , .strike
@:: | ~ .table
@<# :: !
@<< ><
@<< ^
